Based on the search results, the "Edition 25" trim was a special edition of the Volkswagen Caravelle (and Multivan) based on the **T5 generation**, released around 2011 to commemorate the 25th anniversary of the Multivan [2, 3, 7, 10, 14]. The most recent version of the Volkswagen Caravelle is part of the **T6.1 generation** [1, 4, 11, 12].

Therefore, the specific combination of "most recent version" and "Edition 25" trim does not exist for the Volkswagen Caravelle. The data for the Edition 25 trim applies to an older generation (T5), not the most recent T6.1.

